<Layout title="About">
  <!-- Placeholder copy - the user will replace this with their own bio. -->
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    I've got a physics background, and somewhere along the way I got
    interested in exactly how quantum computers threaten the cryptography
    that Bitcoin (and a lot of the internet) relies on.
  </p>
  <p>
    This site is my attempt to explain that threat properly, starting from
    zero. No prior knowledge of quantum computing, cryptography, or Bitcoin
    assumed. Every concept gets explained before it's used.
  </p>
  <p>
    I'm not claiming to be the world's foremost expert on any of this. I'm
    writing these posts the way I wish someone had explained the topic to
    me: honestly, at a reasonable pace, with the math shown rather than
    hand-waved.
  </p>
</Layout>
